#: ../../source/build_config/west_commands.md:8
msgid ""
"West is the unified command-line entry point for UniSDK. UniSDK registers"
" multiple custom command extensions through `scripts/west-commands.yml`."
msgstr "West 是 UniSDK 的统一命令行入口。UniSDK 通过 `scripts/west-commands.yml` 注册了多个自定义命令扩展。"

